    "speedOrContextWin": "all five pairs complete and comparable; median relative improvement >=0.10; every pair same sign; effect exceeds max within-arm relative range; latency additionally needs measured bottleneck and no cache/order confound",
    "tie": "both eligible, same quality vector, absolute median difference <=0.05 and per-arm relative range <=0.05; call no measurable difference, not equivalence",
    "loss": "symmetric win rule reversed",
    "tradeoff": "quality loss prevents overall win even if smaller/faster; report Pareto vector",
